@ivanfioravanti My guess would be October for M5 Ultra, so only two months to wait.

If we extrapolate the numbers we know from M3 Max to M5 Max we'd expect the M5 Ultra to have ~1.25TB/s memory bandwidth and ~110 TFLOPS (dense fp16).

2 Sparks are 546GB/s and ~200 TFLOPS (dense fp16).

